Subject: [PATCH 293/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Add multi-plate height and colour
 stamping.

Read every selected plate from live terrain before updating CHeightmap, then
push the union once and notify affected bakes. This preserves all selected and
overlapping plates during a multi-plate stamp.
